OL,3,GNEWSAFertility patients have treatment
OL,4,A'paused' because of staff absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients starting new fertility
OL,7,Ftreatments at Neath Port Talbot
OL,8,FHospital are facing delays of "at
OL,9,Fleast" four weeks.
OL,11,FSwansea Bay University Health board has
OL,12,Fwritten to patients due to begin
OL,13,Ftreatment to tell them that new
OL,14,Ftreatments have been put on "pause"
OL,15,Fbecause of "absence within key areas of
OL,16,Four workforce".
OL,18,FOne patient, who wanted to remain
OL,19,Fanonymous, said it was "very upsetting"
OL,20,Fto be told of the delay "within days"
OL,21,Fof planned treatment.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
