OL,3,GNEWSAFertility patients have treatment
OL,4,A'paused' because of staff absence
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The IVF process is an incredibly
OL,7,Femotional and time-sensitive process,
OL,8,Fand patients like us here in Wales
OL,9,Fshould not have been put in this
OL,10,Fposition," they said.
